Dear sir/madam,

A set of drivers have developed to drive the DA9052 power management device from Dialog Semiconductor.

Patches for the drivers have been submitted separately to the mailing list:

[1/9] --- MFD
[2/9] --- GPIO
[3/9] --- LED
[4/9] --- POWER (battery charger)
[5/9] --- REGULATOR
[6/9] --- RTC
[7/9] --- WATCHDOG
[8/9] --- TOUCHSCREEN
[9/9] --- CONFIG (feature)

Should you have any queries and comments please feel free to contact me.

